│  • The list_messages method in S3SessionManager                    │
│    (src/strands/session/s3_session_manager.py) retrieves message   │
│    events from an S3 bucket for a given session and agent.         │
│  • It paginates through S3 objects under a messages prefix path,   │
│    collects message keys, sorts them by message index, applies     │
│    pagination limits and offset, reads the corresponding JSON      │
│    message data, and returns a list of SessionMessage objects.     │
│  • The limit parameter defaults to None but is usually set to a    │
